          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Israeli baikele mu Egupto mu mpanga ya Gosheni. Muli iyi mpanga abena Israeli balinonkelemo ifyuma, kabili basanda, bafula nganshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo aikele mu calo ca Egupto imyaka ikumi limo na cine lubali (17), kabili ali ne myaka yakufyalwa umwanda umo na makumi yane na cine lubali (147). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:29"
          },
          "items": [
