              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.50.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "50:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo inshita ya kufwa kwakwa Israeli yapaleme, aitile mwane Yosefu, amweba ati, “Nga cingakusekesha, pisha ukuboko kobe mwisamba lye tanta lyandi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47:29",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mwisamba lye tanta lyandi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ifi efyo balecita ku mulapo uushili wakufilwa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ulape ukuti ukankwatila uluse ne cishinka. Wikanshiika muno Egupto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo nkaya lala ukwalala ifikolwe fyandi, mukamfumye muno mu Egupto mukaye nshiika ukwashiikwa ifikolwe fyandi.” Yosefu amweba ati, “Nkacita ngefyo mwalanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israeli amweba ati, “Kanshi lapa.” Awe Yosefu nao alapa. Elyo Israeli akontamina ku mitwe ya busanshi bwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.31",
